Lojban)?"
What do you mean by 'comfortable'? Fluent enough to use it in all
situations? Not embarrassed when speaking it?
Familiar with the grammar?
I have no idea how to answer that question.
I don't speak Lojban, but I'm familiar with most of the basic grammar and a
lot of the words, as well as with many of the issues Lojban has.

stevo

